gantt
    title Release plan
    dateFormat YYYY-MM-DD
    excludes weekends
    section Build
        Design      :done, design, 2026-01-05, 5d
        Implement   :active, impl, after design, 10d
    section Ship
        Review      :crit, review, after impl, 3d
        Release     :milestone, release, after review, 0d
    click impl href "https://example.com/implement"
